# The technician's worn gear.
ent-WGAdminTechContacts = subspace contacts
    .desc = One of Central Command's best kept secrets, resting on the eyes of many of its officers, operatives, and technicians.
ent-WGAdminTechCytothecaBluespace = bluespace cytotheca
    .desc = Why is it squishy?
ent-WGAdminTechCytothecaSubspace = subspace cytotheca
    .desc = How is this squishier?
ent-WGAdminTechGauntletsBluespace = bluespace gauntlets
    .desc = Extraordinarily lightweight and pleasantly comfortable gauntlets packed full of useful technology. You feel perfectly capable of defending yourself.
ent-WGAdminTechGauntletsSubspace = subspace gauntlets
    .desc = Extraordinarily lightweight and pleasantly comfortable gauntlets packed full of useful technology. You feel perfectly capable of defending yourself. You feel perfectly capable of defending yourself from things that have not happened.
ent-WGAdminTechHeadsetBluespace = bluespace headset
    .desc = Keeps you tuned in on the subspace data streams and threads, enabling you to communicate and act with ease.
ent-WGAdminTechHeadsetSubspace = subspace headset
    .desc = Keeps you tuned in on the subspace data streams and threads, enabling you to communicate and act with ease. This one has stopped bothering to pretend it is only a radio.
ent-WGAdminTechIdAdmin = Admin ID
    .desc = An Admin ID card. Has ALL the all access, you really shouldn't have this.
ent-WGAdminTechIdBluespace = Bluespace ID
    .desc = An Admin ID card. Has ALL the all access, you really shouldn't have this. This one is stamped for a Bluespace Technician.
ent-WGAdminTechIdCentCom = CentCom Master ID
    .desc = A Master ID card from Central Command. Has ALL the all access, to a suspicious degree.
ent-WGAdminTechIdSubspace = Subspace ID
    .desc = An Admin ID card. Has ALL the all access, you really shouldn't have this. This one is stamped for a Subspace Technician, which is not a real posting.
ent-WGAdminTechJacketBluespace = bluespace letterman
    .desc = Hand-stitched by legendary tailors, these jackets are made specifically for each technician. Using the same advanced fabrics and techniques as the rest of their soft kit, the comfort of these coats is unrivaled.
ent-WGAdminTechJacketSubspace = subspace letterman
    .desc = Hand-stitched by legendary tailors, these jackets are made specifically for each technician. Using the same advanced fabrics and techniques as the rest of their soft kit, the comfort of these coats is unrivaled.
ent-WGAdminTechMagbootsBluespace = bluespace magboots
    .desc = Exotic hand manufactured booties made of the finest alloys the Frontier has to offer. The bluespace crystals powering each boot gleam threateningly.
ent-WGAdminTechMagbootsSubspace = subspace magboots
    .desc = Exotic hand manufactured booties made of the finest alloys the Frontier has to offer. The bluespace crystals powering each boot gleam threateningly. These ones gleam a good deal more threateningly.
ent-WGAdminTechMaskBluespace = bluespace mask
    .desc = A proprietary filtration mask which route gasses that CentCom deems toxic directly into the space between dimensions. Wasteful? Totally. Convenient? Extremely. Has the added side effect of partially displacing you into that dimension.
ent-WGAdminTechMaskSubspace = subspace mask
    .desc = A proprietary filtration mask which route gasses that CentCom deems toxic directly into the space between dimensions. Wasteful? Totally. Convenient? Extremely. Has the added side effect of partially displacing you into that dimension. This one displaces rather more of you, and rather more permanently.
ent-WGAdminTechSatchelBluespace = bluespace technician's satchel
    .desc = A hand crafted satchel made of the finest materials, processes, and a creatively integrated bluespace anomaly core. This one was carefully prestocked and organized by a Central Command Quartermaster to service an engineering aligned technician.
ent-WGAdminTechSatchelSubspace = subspace technician's satchel
    .desc = A hand crafted satchel made of the finest materials, processes, and a creatively integrated bluespace anomaly core. This one was prestocked by a Central Command Quartermaster who was told to stop asking what any of it was for.
ent-WGAdminTechShieldProjectorBluespace = bluespace shield projector
    .desc = A cutting edge energy shield designed for Central Command's technicians.
ent-WGAdminTechShieldProjectorSubspace = subspace shield projector
    .desc = A narrative-bending energy shield designed for Central Command's technicians.
ent-WGAdminTechUniformBluespace = bluespace techsuit
    .desc = A perfectly tailored and customized skin suit made specifically for this technician. Composed of experimental textiles, and assembled with the legendary Bluespace Sewing Machine, it fits the body with perfect comfort, and carries an air of security.
ent-WGAdminTechUniformSubspace = subspace techsuit
    .desc = A perfectly tailored and customized skin suit made specifically for this technician. Composed of experimental textiles, and assembled with the legendary Bluespace Sewing Machine, it fits the body with perfect comfort, and carries an air of security. The tailoring on this one accounts for damage it has not taken yet.
ent-WGAdminTechVisorBluespace = bluespace visor
    .desc = This exceptional piece of headgear seems to be one of the main reality-warping sources of the administrative kit. It feels nearly weightless on your head.
ent-WGAdminTechVisorSubspace = subspace visor
    .desc = This exceptional piece of headgear seems to be one of the main reality-warping sources of the administrative kit. It feels nearly weightless on your head. This one stopped pretending to be armour and simply refuses to let anything reach you.
